# Target snapshots are raw serialized captures (see proc/src/snapshot.rs
# for why they are not compressed): stored uncompressed so that git
# delta-compresses consecutive recaptures, which a compressed frame
# would defeat. Do not add -delta here — that is the effect being
# relied on. They are not text and have no diff worth rendering.
hansei-runtime/tests/fixtures/**/*.snapshot -diff merge=binary
